    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. also just curious, since we're talking about the soil health, i've been hearing from some other farmers in the area that sometimes stuff just gets \"stagnant\" or weirdly unpredictable even when the NPK looks okay. is there anything else i should look for in the soil biology or microbes that might affect how the kale takes up the nutrients?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
