    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "makes sense. i'll look into some compost tea. it's just weird because sometimes the soil feels like it has this... i don't know, hidden energy? like there's something else going on beneath the surface that the lab tests don't pick up. do you think there's any other hidden or \"unseen\" factors that can influence how a crop behaves during a growing season?",
